    "# BERTopic-Based Song Recommendation System (GPU-Optimized)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook implements a GPU-accelerated BERTopic-based music recommendation system. It includes:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **GPU Setup & Detection** - Automatically configure GPU acceleration\n",
    "2. **Data preprocessing** - Optimized for GPU memory management\n",
    "3. **GPU-accelerated BERTopic training** - Using transformer embeddings on GPU\n",
    "4. **LLM-assisted topic labeling** - GPT-powered interpretable topic names\n",
    "5. **GPU-optimized similarity calculation** - Fast cosine similarity on GPU\n",
    "6. **Diversity-aware recommendations** - MMR with GPU acceleration\n",
    "7. **Interactive visualizations** - GPU-accelerated plots and analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🚀 GPU Optimizations:\n",
    "- **CUDA-accelerated** transformer embeddings\n",
    "- **GPU-optimized** HDBSCAN clustering\n",
    "- **Batch processing** with memory management\n",
    "- **Mixed precision** training support\n",
    "- **Automatic scaling** based on GPU memory\n"
   ]
  },
